{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>And from them we will not demand, and I imposed an oath upon them</b> — by means of the priests, for they are the ones who administer oaths, as in the matter of \"and the priest shall impose the oath upon the woman\"; therefore he called them." "<b>And from them we will not demand</b> — its meaning is: and from them we will not demand the loan."], :book :nehemiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Nehemiah -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/nechemya"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:15:06.295199265Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}